# Substrate patch series for GNU gdb 16.2.  Ordering matters — the bfd
# vec patches must precede the targets.c / configure / config.bfd ones
# that reference the new vec names.
#
# 0002..0006 are contrib/binutils/patches/0002..0006 re-generated against
# gdb-16.2's bundled bfd, which is a different vintage: applying the
# binutils versions directly needs fuzz up to 3, and one of those fuzzy
# hunks lands inside the x86_64-*-redox* case and silently splits it.
# These apply with zero fuzz.
0001-config-sub-substrate.patch
0002-elf-common-osabi-substrate.patch
0003-bfd-elf-substrate-vecs.patch
0004-bfd-targets-substrate.patch
0005-bfd-configure-substrate.patch
0006-bfd-config-bfd-substrate.patch
